I got a job at 97.1 FM.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.870
On the street team, that's
where you gotta start.

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:55.260
And cut to me starting
to do standup in 2016

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.910
