00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.122
Let's call him.

00:02:23.122 --> 00:02:26.310
(audience cheers)

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:28.170
Thanks, Brendan, yes, yes, yes.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:29.730
Okay, wait, I'm gonna call him.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:30.930
- [Sherry] Carson Daly!

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:33.240
- I love Carson, he's
one of my favorite people

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.073
