- You should.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.120
- Carson, I made it.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.650
- Oh my gosh, of course you made it.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.510
Look at you, Sherry, you're the best.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.520
I'm so happy for all of your success.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.990
This is the coolest story.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:59.640
- What were your first impressions of me?

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:00.690
I have to know.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:04.140
- Oh my gosh, I mean, you were
on my radio show years ago,

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.540
