he'll be, like, cool with it."

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.083
You know?

00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:09.916
- I literally...

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:10.749
- [Kelly] He's so cool.

00:04:10.749 --> 00:04:12.660
